# Search: token refresh

*3 matches in 2 sessions, `/home/dev/app`*

## 1. Fix token refresh

`aaaa1111` · 2026-03-01 09:00 – 2026-03-02 17:45 · turns 0–3 · 2 matches in turns 1, 2

**#0 👤 User · 2026-03-01 09:00**

> Why does the token refresh fail after an hour?

**#1 🤖 Claude · 2026-03-01 09:01** · match · `claudegrep read aaaa1111 --from 1.0`

> The clock skew check compared local time with UTC.
>
> So tokens looked expired early.

**#1 🤖 Claude · 2026-03-01 09:01**

> ## Fix
>
> - convert both sides to UTC
> - allow 30 s of skew

**#2 🛰 Agent · 2026-03-01 09:02** · `claudegrep read aaaa1111 --from 2.0` · also in 2 other places

> Task: Find token refresh
>
> Tokens are refreshed in src/auth.rs.

