**Reading more**

- `-B N`, `-A N`, `-C N` on this search: the N chunks before, after or around each match
- `-n N` on this search: more matches, so more sessions (now 8)
- `--since 2w`, `--until 2026-10-01`: only sessions active in that window
- `claudegrep read <id> --from TURN.PART`: read on from a match, paged; each page ends with the `--from` that continues it
- `claudegrep read <id> --outline`: one line per turn, to pick where to read
- `--deep` on read: also tool calls, tool results and thinking
